{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758","id":5549990110,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABSs4g3g","number":758,"title":"NaH2PO4 monohydrate spellings sit on the dihydrate record and their 36 recipe occurrences count toward anhydrous NaH2PO4","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10370025893,"node_id":"LA_kwDORhCjFc8AAAACahoJpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-23T07:04:26Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:10:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Review finding on #757 (read-only pass), the same wrong-form class that PR retires, but with membership consequences.\n\n`Nah2po4_X_2_H2o.yaml` (local identity `kgmicrobe.compound:nah2po4_x_2_h2o`, the dihydrate label) carries six `HYDRATE_FORM` synonyms from kg-microbe, three of which are **monohydrate** spellings: `NaH2PO4 x H2O`, `NaH2PO4·H2O`, `NaH2PO4・H2O`. The monohydrate has its own record, `Sodium_phosphate_monobasic_monohydrate` (CHEBI:114249), which after #755 also owns the raw `NaH2PO4•H2O` labels.\n\nCultureMech's occurrence table names those three strings in **36 recipes** (34 + 1 + 1) and resolves all of them to `CHEBI:37585`, the anhydrous `NaH2PO4`, so the anhydrous record's membership and counts include 36 monohydrate recipes; the dihydrate spellings (`x 2H2O`, `·2H2O`, `・2H2O`, 4 recipes) resolve there too.\n\nFix, in the batch-3/4 shape: move the three monohydrate strings onto the monohydrate record (`REJECTED_LABEL` on the dihydrate), add `SOURCE_LABEL_IDENTIFIER_OVERRIDES` entries for all six spellings (three → CHEBI:114249, three → the dihydrate local id), move the membership edges off CHEBI:37585, and refresh the three records' counts from the edges. Fixed in #757's review round.\n\nRelated: #232, #459, #755.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/758/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}